    "title": "Car coloring games - Color car",
    "description": "Come to become a car drawing and coloring art master. Color, paint, draw, collect, and build your own car painting kingdom in Car Coloring games! Discover rare and exciting cars traffic boys and girls have never seen before!\r\n\r\nCar Color drawing is a fun and classic coloring game designed for car enthusiasts ot confined to boys and girls. Join us to color pop many cool cars fan, and enjoy a relaxing time. \r\n\r\nDon\u2019t worry about painting and coloring skills, just follow the number prompts to paint color each part with the correct color.\r\n\r\nPainting not only kills time but also brings a sense of accomplishment. With plenty of cool cars to choose from, you can explore and learn interesting facts about each one. Spot rare cars and paint them to perfection, while having fun in the process.\r\n\r\nCar Coloring Games gameplay:\r\n\r\n1.Choose a car that needs painting.\r\n2.Follow the number prompts or choose your own color order.\r\n3.Check the prompt to see the correct colors to use.\r\n4.Paint each part and enjoy your masterpiece!\r\n\r\nBuild your own car kingdom and enjoy the fun of painting! Try Car Coloring now!\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/zero-maze-family",
    "descriptionHTML": "Come to become a car drawing and coloring art master. Color, paint, draw, collect, and build your own car painting kingdom in Car Coloring games! Discover rare and exciting cars traffic boys and girls have never seen before!<br><br>Car Color drawing is a fun and classic coloring game designed for car enthusiasts ot confined to boys and girls. Join us to color pop many cool cars fan, and enjoy a relaxing time. <br><br>Don\u2019t worry about painting and coloring skills, just follow the number prompts to paint color each part with the correct color.<br><br>Painting not only kills time but also brings a sense of accomplishment. With plenty of cool cars to choose from, you can explore and learn interesting facts about each one. Spot rare cars and paint them to perfection, while having fun in the process.<br><br>Car Coloring Games gameplay:<br><br>1.Choose a car that needs painting.<br>2.Follow the number prompts or choose your own color order.<br>3.Check the prompt to see the correct colors to use.<br>4.Paint each part and enjoy your masterpiece!<br><br>Build your own car kingdom and enjoy the fun of painting! Try Car Coloring now!<br>Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/zero-maze-family",
